  "description": "Active Query Builder ASP.NET Edition is a Visual SQL Query Builder for ASP.NET WebForms, MVC and Core 2.0 environments with full support of all popular database servers and appropriate SQL dialects. Working with Active Query Builder the end-user can combine visual query building with direct SQL query text editing, preview sub-query results. Active Query Builder allows for parsing of complex SQL queries for their visual representation as well as for programmatic analysis and modification.This package should be used in MVC .NET projects. Packages for WebForms and ASP.NET Core environments are available separately.",
